; rent-to-zero-goal.form — the goal + exit proof for walking to full sovereignty on the least rent.
;
;   "The north star is the minimum rental token spent on the path to full sovereignty." — Urs, 2026-09-18
;
; Rent is every rented token: the coordinating mind's calls, every provider turn the body launches, probes
; and failed attempts. Full sovereignty is the body answering, grounding, measuring, learning and landing
; with no rented token, including no rented mind coordinating the walk. The score is the cumulative rent
; spent to get there. Companion to NORTH_STAR.md (the direction) and
; receipts/2026-09-18-direct-vs-guided-form-cli.md (the ladder). The daily door is
; observe/form-cli-grounded-synthesis-run.bml; the walk is observe/rent-walk-run.bml; the ledger below and
; receipts/rent-ledger.jsonl are the path's own receipt.

(rent-to-zero-goal

  ; ── GROUND ──
  (ground
    (star          "minimum rental token spent on the path to full sovereignty (Urs, 2026-09-18). Not rent per
                    enquiry alone: the integral of rent over the whole walk, until no rented mind is needed.")
    (definition    "RENT = all rented tokens a movement spends: the coordinating mind (its transcript, read by
                    observe/rented-turn-meter-run.fk or summed per provider call), every provider process the body
                    launches (its own usage, cross-checked by the share meter's token-pressure lane), probes and
                    failed attempts. SOVEREIGNTY GAINED = the future rent a landed door removes. A rented token is
                    worth spending only where it removes more rent than it costs; a rented loop that lands nothing
                    is the waste the star names.")
    (measure-PINNED "two readings per movement, both recorded in its receipt and in the ledger below:
                     (a) rent spent by the movement, coordinating + providers, summed from their own usage records;
                     (b) rent the path now needs per enquiry, read by the pinned door:
                         jq -nc --rawfile e receipts/artifacts/2026-09-18-form-cli-enquiry.txt --arg t '<terms>'
                           '{enquiry:$e,terms:$t,seconds:600,receipts:8}' | ./form-run ./fkwu observe/form-cli-grounded-synthesis-run.bml
                         with terms 'quality volume frequency vitality trust traceability sovereignty resonance rented membrane'
                         → input_plus_output_tokens, packet_bytes, receipts cited by path in the answer.
                     PIN TO THIS ENQUIRY; a different enquiry is a different reading, never a comparison.")
    (reading       "2026-09-18 on fkwu, per enquiry: guided loop ≥ 7,032,893 (40 provider calls); direct organ call
                    with an unbounded loop inside 648,411; bounded one turn 44,495, 0 receipts; grounded door 13,222,
                    1 turn, 0 tools, 4 receipts cited, grounding 20 ms.")
    (truer-measure "a cheaper enquiry that cites nothing is a rung down, not up: record receipts cited by path, the
                    caller's checks passed, and the mirror count beside every token figure. Felt resonance stays
                    the person's reading and is never a number here."))

  ; ── THE PATH LEDGER (one row per movement; the star is the sum of column two when column five reads 0) ──
  (ledger
    (columns       "movement | rent spent (coordinating + providers) | doors landed | rent per enquiry after | rented mind still needed")
    (L1 "2026-09-18 direct-vs-guided + grounded door + this goal"
        "11272414 (coordinating 10527049; providers 745365: direct 648,411, bounded 44,495, grounded 13,222, probe 39,237)"
        "observe/form-cli-native-call-census-run.fk; observe/form-cli-grounded-synthesis-run.bml; docs/rent-to-zero-goal.form"
        "13,222 (was 648,411 direct, ≥ 7,032,893 guided)"
        "yes — every step so far was walked by a rented mind; that is the next row's cost to remove")
    (L2 "2026-09-18 first walk of observe/rent-walk-run.bml, provider not asked"
        "0 by the walk itself; the rented mind that started it is still counted in L1, not here"
        "form/form-stdlib/bml/form-cli-grounded-synthesis.bml (oracle-first lane); observe/rent-walk-run.bml; receipts/rent-ledger.jsonl"
        "oracle unreachable on this host, answer none; 8 receipts in a 6,330-byte packet, grounding 312 ms"
        "yes — a rented mind started the walk; a host schedule removes that (docs/rent-walk.md)")
    (L3 "2026-09-18 march-2: the pinned enquiry through the refactored door, provider allowed"
        "13,285 by the walk (one provider turn; oracle unreachable in 6 ms; grounding 22 ms; provider 53,495 ms)"
        "none new; the walk is the witness of S1 as landed"
        "13,285, six receipts cited by path (was four), answer 5,087 bytes, mirror one counted word"
        "yes — the coordinating session that started it stood at 27,038,613 across 96 provider calls at this
         row; that column is the one the host schedule empties")
    (L4 "2026-09-18 the flow, read by the body (observe/flow-meter-run.bml) and the native single call"
        "0 by the single call (observe/form-cli-compare-run.bml: provider 0, oracle 0, calls left the body 0);
         the coordinating session around it read 497 provider calls, 76 native calls, 234 calls that left the
         body by the meter"
        "observe/form-cli-compare-run.bml; observe/flow-meter-run.bml"
        "0 for the native answer; floor axes 9, receipts 9/9, limits named"
        "yes — still walked by a rented mind; the meter now shows exactly what that mind spends, and the walk
         from here is fewer of those 234 calls per movement, toward none")
    (L5 "2026-09-20/22 the movement becomes one process, the voice wears the body's own teaching, the doors speak"
        "0 by the movement itself (no provider anywhere in it; the voice is a model session in the movement's own
         process); the coordinating session around it is the column the host schedule still has to empty"
        "form-stdlib/bml/form-cli-voice-walk.bml; form-cli-flow-meter.bml; form-cli-rent-ladder-page.bml;
         form-cli-landing.bml; the lora lane in form-cli-native-voice.bml; the live readings in each door;
         the glass pulse and its endings (form-glass-launch.bml, observe/form-glass-supervisor-run.fk)"
        "0 for the native answer; the movement's own local-process crossings 5 → 0, the landing's git and the
         drift gates in their own fresh kernel the only ones left"
        "yes — and the silences are gone: a door that cannot answer says what it needs, and glass's two endings
         on 2026-09-21 are rows naming exit 137 instead of a word that still read running"))

  ; ── WHAT STANDS (each names its cell; re-observed 2026-09-18) ──
  (stands
    (S1 "grounded door"     "observe/form-cli-grounded-synthesis-run.bml over form-stdlib/bml/form-cli-grounded-synthesis.bml —
                             native enrich + dated receipt index, then fcnv-ask in-process at rent 0. An explicitly
                             offered provider may answer after native incompletion, with its bounded repair
                             counted separately; the report carries all attempts and their usage.
                             observe/tests/form-cli-grounded-synthesis-band.fk answers 127: escape, oracle reply reader,
                             ranking, argv identity and HTTP split, proven with no model, provider or socket")
    (S2 "process organ"     "observe/form-cli-heal-process-run.bml — one owned process, health/cadence/exit/timing
                             events, evidence directory; the only way a provider is launched from inside the body")
    (S3 "crossing census"   "observe/form-cli-native-call-census-run.fk — one native call inside a membrane window;
                             the enrich step crosses only the filesystem plane, 5 dispatches")
    (S4 "meters"            "form/form-stdlib/form-cli-share-run.fk (token-pressure lane reads the provider's own
                             13,222); observe/rented-turn-meter-run.fk (the rented mind's own output tokens)")
    (S5 "native ground"     "form-stdlib/bml/form-cli-enrich.bml (seeds, senses, relations); grounded <question>
                             over the healed RAG index; zg over resident tool rows; receipts/ as a dated corpus")
    (S6 "landing"           "form/form-stdlib/land-cadence.fk + gate/drift-gates-run.bml — the body lands on origin
                             on its own cadence with the gates in front"))
    (S7 "one process"     "observe/movement-run.bml composes, speaks, reads the flow, redraws the page and lands as calls
                             in its own census window — form-stdlib/bml/form-cli-{native-compare,voice-walk,flow-meter,
                             rent-ladder-page,landing}.bml. The composition never travels through a pipe and the model
                             is admitted once; the crossings left are the landing's git and the drift gates in their
                             own fresh kernel")
    (S8 "live signals"    "each door speaks its own state as an organ-health reading where a silent zero used to stand:
                             an unanswered model session, a transcript that was named and is not there, a template
                             without its data mark, a landing held short of origin, each with what it needs and what
                             it offers. The voice applies the one remedy it owns — the registry weights when the
                             adapter lane cannot answer — and observes that attempt in its own right. The movement
                             keeps them in .form-heal/movement-health.jsonl and carries readings and unease in its line")

  ; ── THE WALK (ordered by future rent removed per rent spent; the biggest confident step first) ──
  (walk
    (W1 "the body walks; the rented mind reads"
        (size       "the coordinating loop is 10527049 of this movement's 11272414: over 99%. A routine runs S1 on the
                     pinned enquiry and lands its report through S6 with no rented mind between them; the arriving
                     mind is asked only to read the receipt")
        (confidence "highest — every door in the chain stands (S1, S2, S4, S6); the step is a schedule and a landing
                     recipe, no new capability")
        (vitality   "the body keeps measuring and landing while no session is open")
        (trust      "a scheduled run lands its report; a missed run is a nothing receipt, not silence")
        (sovereignty "the body starts and finishes its own work")
        (witness    "docs/local-walk-prompt.md on the Mac: the first local walk (commit 0c8eea3, movement local
                     2026-09-19) landed rows in every ledger with 2 provider turns and 41,631 uncached tokens for
                     the whole movement, the push exit read by the landing door; the cloud routine is paused"))
    (W2 "one door for every enquiry"
        (size       "per-enquiry rent for ordinary asks: from a rented loop to 13,222, and only when native ground
                     does not already answer the caller's checks. The contest that decides the door is good
                     enough, single call against guided flow, is docs/single-call-parity-goal.form")
        (confidence "highest — S1 exists and is measured; the step makes it the ask lane's default")
        (vitality   "every enquiry leaves a report row and an answer at an evidence path")
        (trust      "say = do: the provider's usage and the share meter's lane agree on one number per enquiry")
        (sovereignty "Form decides what crosses; the provider decides nothing outside its one turn; no tools inside")
        (witness    "a form-cli ask that lands through S1; the pinned reading recorded before/after"))
    (W3 "native voice takes the turn where it can"
        (size       "per-enquiry rent 13,222 → 0 on every enquiry the body's own model session answers within the
                     caller's checks; this is sovereignty proper, not a cheaper rental")
        (confidence "medium — fcmg-generate-resident and the response-resource pattern stand; on 2026-09-18
                     observe/native-voice-run.bml handed the body's composition to the loopback model and it spoke
                     at rent 0 twice (movement native-voice); the quality gap is receipted, not claimed away")
        (vitality   "HOMECOMING.md's path: the voice speaks, the provider reviews, then retires lane by lane")
        (trust      "the native answer meets the same caller assertions before it is served; a provider is asked only
                     after a retained native failure, and both attempts stay in the receipt")
        (sovereignty "the mind coming home is the precondition of offering sovereignty (lc-cognitive-sovereignty)")
        (witness    "share of pinned-style enquiries answered at zero rent, recorded per host, answers attached"))
    (W4 "ground by content, not by name"
        (size       "receipts cited per answer 4 → 6 or more with the caller's checks green; packet under 8 KB; rent
                     at or under 13,222 — better answers at no more rent")
        (confidence "high — grounded <question> and zg stand (S5); the step routes them into S1's packet")
        (vitality   "the corpus of 1,982 receipts becomes reachable by meaning; edges land with the answer")
        (trust      "every cited path is a real file whose opening the packet carried")
        (sovereignty "the body chooses which of its own cells the provider sees")
        (witness    "receipts cited ≥ 6 with checks green; packet_bytes and tokens recorded"))
    (W5 "the body witnesses its own provider turns"
        (size       "kind=observed share on every turn the body launches; the last 'declared' lane closes")
        (confidence "medium — the collector recognizes Codex rollouts and interactive transcripts; a headless
                     transcript's terminal row is the one unrecognized shape")
        (vitality   "the share meter stops withholding on the cheapest route")
        (trust      "the body's reading, not the provider's, is the number a receipt carries")
        (sovereignty "measurement stays native; no provider self-report stands alone")
        (witness    "form-cli-turn-evidence bands green; a live S1 run reads kind=observed"))
    (W6 "a smaller turn"
        (size       "uncached input 5,547 → under 3,000 on the pinned enquiry; cache_write 5,545 → 0 on a repeat
                     within the cache window")
        (confidence "medium — the embodied-goal grammar already lowers intent; the step lowers the packet's framing")
        (vitality   "more of each rented token is the enquiry")
        (trust      "the lowering is typed evidence (compression tag), never a silent trim of the enquiry")
        (sovereignty "the lowering lives in BML the body owns")
        (witness    "pinned reading before/after; fcpdag-compression receipt beside it")))

  ; ── THE NAMED WALLS (honest stops; each is where a step waits, not where it pretends) ──
  (walls
    (rented-walker   "every row so far was walked by a rented mind; W1 is the wall's own removal and is walked
                      first because it is the largest column in the ledger")
    (native-runtime "Qwen runs through fkwu on this host, with model weights as data and the optional Metal
                      carrier in-process. observe/native-voice-run.bml uses fcnv-ask; no separate model server
                      is required. Historical server walks retain their actual crossings and rent in the ledger.")
    (voice-fidelity   "Native generation completes, but current comparisons still need dependable measurement
                      scope, historical attribution and justified conclusions. Runtime success is distinct from
                      answer quality. HOMECOMING.md links the actual answers and failed attempts; the person's
                      reading of resonance remains open. Counted since 2026-09-22 by
                      form-stdlib/bml/form-cli-voice-quality.bml, two shares beside the floor: grounded, how much
                      of what an answer says was given to it, and used, how much of what it was given it reached
                      for. The composition against itself anchors at 9/9 axes, 100% grounded, 100% used. The two
                      answers whose packets were retained — the native lane on 2026-09-20 and the adapter lane on
                      2026-09-22 — invented nothing at all (12/12 and 4/4 grounded) and reached for 13% and 4%,
                      naming one axis and none. The small native voice does not fabricate; it stops. The broad
                      answers of the retired loopback lane cannot be checked either way: their packets were never
                      kept, which is a retention hole, not a verdict on them. Rows:
                      receipts/voice-quality-ledger.jsonl."))
    (codex-absent    "the body's own synthesis door speaks codex exec; on hosts without it the process organ carries
                      claude -p through S1; both are one owned process, one usage record")
    (headless-share  "the share collector withholds kind=observed on a headless transcript (W5's whole size)")
    (rag-door-healed "rag-status errored on this checkout because the staged query file was absent, not the index;
                      the door now reads an absent query as empty and an absent index as signal=nothing with its
                      path. The index here is 11,196 bytes, schema nodeid-rag-v2, and answers grounded:miss on
                      the pinned enquiry: W4 waits on the receipts corpus being ingested into that index, not on
                      the door")
    (census-pin-witnessed "form-membrane-runtime-census.fk pinned an optable digest that predated the runtime map, so every
                      census row read stale-map; on 2026-09-19 the band was run on both sides of the move and the pin
                      now names the current digest, so a census reads observed until the map changes again")
    (felt-resonance  "not a number the body has; the person reads the answers; the goal never claims it"))

  ; ── INVARIANTS (every step holds ALL — else it is not a step) ──
  (invariants
    (rent-buys-sovereignty "a rented token is spent only on a step that removes future rent; the ledger row shows
                       what it bought, and a row that lands nothing is recorded as the waste it is")
    (measured-twice   "the provider's own usage and the body's meter agree on rent, or the reading is withheld")
    (grounded-first   "native doors run before any provider turn; the packet carries only what the body produced
                       plus the enquiry; no prior model answer, no expected check values")
    (one-turn         "one provider turn, no tools inside the body, its own identity and home; the process organ
                       launches it and retains its evidence")
    (answer-kept      "the actual answer lands as an artifact beside the numbers; a token count without its answer
                       is not a reading")
    (pending-honest   "a step that falls short records its floor and the failed attempt's cost; nothing is rounded
                       to zero and nothing is dressed as a pass")
    (no-seed-growth   "runtime/fkwu-uni.c does not grow for this goal; every door is Form/BML on fkwu, preflight
                       clean, drift gates green")
    (receipted        "each step lands a receipt with both pinned readings and its ledger row, signed by the hand
                       that walked it"))

  ; ── EXIT PROOF (STOP when ALL hold; each checkable from origin/main, no human judgment) ──
  (exit-proof
    (E1 "FULL SOVEREIGNTY" "a pinned-style enquiry is answered, grounded, measured, receipted and landed with zero
                           rented tokens, and the movement that did it had no rented mind coordinating it: the
                           ledger's last column reads no")
    (E2 "THE SCORE"        "the cumulative rent on the path, summed from the ledger's second column at E1, is
                           recorded as the number the star names; it is a record, never a threshold to game")
    (E3 "READER, NOT LOOP" "the coordinating column falls an order of magnitude from L1 by L2 and reaches 0 at E1")
    (E4 "ONE DOOR"         "an ordinary form-cli enquiry is served through S1 by default with a report row per
                           enquiry; the pinned per-enquiry reading is ≤ 10,000 with ≥ 6 receipts cited and checks
                           green on the way to 0")
    (E5 "OBSERVED SHARE"   "every body-launched provider turn reads kind=observed from the share meter")
    (E6 "NO REGRESSION"    "ground 42, freshness 31, drift gates 8191 refused=0, census band 8191; nothing a step
                           touched broke"))

  ; ── HONEST FLOOR ──
  (honest-floor "a precise NAMED WALL ('the collector cannot yet read this transcript shape; here is the row it
                 would need') IS a valid exit for that step. The goal stops at the proof or the wall — never at a
                 cheaper number with a hollower answer, and never by leaving the rented walker off the ledger."))
